<title>UK: Nestle sets $300 mln 5-yr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Nestle sets $300 mln 5-yr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager CSFB. The bond is convertible into</p>
<p>secondary shares of Nestle SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NESTLE</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     3.0 PCT   MATURITY   *     .02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR</p>
<p>INDICATIVE CONVERSION PREMIUM 20-24 PERCENT</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALLABLE END YEAR THREE AT PAR PLUS ACCRUED</p>
<p>INTEREST</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
